  },
  data: {
    LLM: 'After six cards each and a turned trump indicator, eldest hand may stand or beg. If begging is accepted, dealer runs three more cards each and turns again until trump suit changes. In play, highest trump wins a trick; if no trump is played, highest card of the led suit wins. Players with the led suit may either follow suit or play trump, but cannot throw a non-trump card of another suit when they could follow. Score hand points in order High, Low, Jack, Game; first side to target wins the game.',
    Player: 'After six cards each and a turned trump indicator, eldest hand may stand or beg. If begging is accepted, dealer runs three more cards each and turns again until trump suit changes. In play, highest trump wins a trick; if no trump is played, highest card of the led suit wins. Players with the led suit may either follow suit or play trump, but cannot throw a non-trump card of another suit when they could follow. Score hand points in order High, Low, Jack, Game; first side to target wins the game.',
    objective: 'Reach the target score by collecting High, Low, Jack, and Game points each hand.',
    gameplay: 'After six cards each and a turned trump indicator, eldest hand may stand or beg. If begging is accepted, dealer runs three more cards each and turns again until trump suit changes. In play, highest trump wins a trick; if no trump is played, highest card of the led suit wins. Players with the led suit may either follow suit or play trump, but cannot throw a non-trump card of another suit when they could follow. Score hand points in order High, Low, Jack, Game; first side to target wins the game.',
    keyRules: [
      'High: point to side originally holding highest trump dealt.',
      'Low: point to side originally holding lowest trump dealt.',
      'Jack: point if your side wins trick containing jack of trumps (hang-jack variants award extra on capture).',
      'Game: point to side with higher trick-card value total (A=4, K=3, Q=2, J=1, 10=10).',
      'Scores are pegged in fixed order High, Low, Jack, Game to resolve close finishes.',
    ],
    bonusRuleGuids: [],
    useTrump: true,
    trumpBonusValues: null,
